  "recordedAt": "2026-04-23T13:00:00Z",
  "contextText": "First meeting with Varden Insurance about their claims portal.",
  "hasTranscript": true,
  "speakers": [
    {
      "id": "m16-spk-a",
      "label": "A",
      "displayName": "Alex Rivera"
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-spk-b",
      "label": "B",
      "displayName": "Rosa Delgado"
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-spk-c",
      "label": "C",
      "displayName": "Ben Adeyemi"
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-spk-d",
      "label": "D",
      "displayName": "Hana Sato"
    }
  ],
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "m16-s001",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-a",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 6300,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Thanks for having us. We'd love to hear what's going on with the claims portal."
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s002",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-b",
      "startMs": 6550,
      "endMs": 14750,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "I'm Rosa Delgado, claims director at Varden Insurance. The portal is where policyholders file and track claims, and it's painful."
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s003",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-c",
      "startMs": 15000,
      "endMs": 23200,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Ben Adeyemi, I'm on the IT side at Varden. I look after the portal and the policy systems behind it."
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s004",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-d",
      "startMs": 23450,
      "endMs": 28610,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Hana Sato, account director at Larkspur. I'll look after the commercial side."
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s005",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-a",
      "startMs": 28860,
      "endMs": 32120,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "How much traffic does the portal handle?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s006",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-b",
      "startMs": 32370,
      "endMs": 39810,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "About 9,000 claims a month. And our call centre gets swamped with people asking where their claim is."
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s007",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-c",
      "startMs": 40060,
      "endMs": 44460,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "The portal is fifteen years old. Every change takes months."
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s008",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-a",
      "startMs": 44710,
      "endMs": 47590,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "So you're thinking about a rebuild?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s009",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-b",
      "startMs": 47840,
      "endMs": 56800,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "A claims portal rebuild, yes. But I don't want to jump straight into a build. I want to understand the options first."
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s010",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-d",
      "startMs": 57050,
      "endMs": 60310,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "A short discovery would make sense then."
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s011",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-b",
      "startMs": 60560,
      "endMs": 66100,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Agreed. We've decided to run a six-week discovery before committing to any build."
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s012",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-a",
      "startMs": 66350,
      "endMs": 70750,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "That's sensible. What do you need from us to start?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s013",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-c",
      "startMs": 71000,
      "endMs": 77300,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "You'll need to understand the architecture. I'll send you the architecture diagrams by next Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s014",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-a",
      "startMs": 77550,
      "endMs": 80810,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Perfect. Any constraints we should know about?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s015",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-c",
      "startMs": 81060,
      "endMs": 87360,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "The policy systems are off limits for now. Anything touching them needs the CIO's approval."
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s016",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-b",
      "startMs": 87610,
      "endMs": 91250,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "And the CIO is not a fast approver."
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s017",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-a",
      "startMs": 91500,
      "endMs": 95900,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Understood, we'll design discovery to stay in the portal layer."
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s018",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-d",
      "startMs": 96150,
      "endMs": 100930,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "On the commercial side, I'll send a discovery proposal by Monday."
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s019",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-b",
      "startMs": 101180,
      "endMs": 109760,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Good. One more thing, I'm having surgery in June and will be out for two weeks. Ben will cover for me."
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s020",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-a",
      "startMs": 110010,
      "endMs": 114790,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Thanks for telling us, Rosa. We'll plan the milestones around that."
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s021",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-c",
      "startMs": 115040,
      "endMs": 120200,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "I'm usually easier to reach on chat than email, by the way."
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s022",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-a",
      "startMs": 120450,
      "endMs": 122570,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Noted. Hana, anything else?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s023",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-d",
      "startMs": 122820,
      "endMs": 126840,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Only that we'd like a named sponsor for discovery."
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s024",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-b",
      "startMs": 127090,
      "endMs": 128450,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "That's me."
    },
    {
      "id": "m16-s025",
      "speakerId": "m16-spk-a",
      "startMs": 128700,
      "endMs": 130440,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Great, thanks both."
    }
  ],
  "note": {
    "version": 1,
    "body": "# Varden Insurance claims portal introduction\n\n**Date:** April 23\n**Attendees:** Alex Rivera (Larkspur Labs), Hana Sato (Larkspur Labs), Rosa Delgado (Varden Insurance), Ben Adeyemi (Varden Insurance)\n\n## Summary\n\nFirst meeting with Varden Insurance about their claims portal, where policyholders file and track claims. Rosa Delgado, claims director, is the sponsor. Ben Adeyemi on the Varden IT side looks after the portal and the policy systems behind it.\n\n## Context\n\n- The portal handles about 9,000 claims a month.\n- The call centre is swamped with policyholders asking where their claim is.\n- The portal is fifteen years old; every change takes months.\n- Rosa wants a claims portal rebuild but wants to understand the options before committing to a build.\n\n## Decisions\n\n- Varden will run a **six-week discovery** before committing to any build. Rosa is the named sponsor.\n- Discovery stays in the portal layer. The policy systems are off limits; anything touching them needs approval from Varden's CIO, who is not a fast approver.\n\n## Action items\n\n- **Ben Adeyemi** — send the architecture diagrams by next Tuesday.\n- **Hana Sato** — send a discovery proposal by Monday.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Rosa will be out for two weeks in June; Ben covers for her. Milestones should be planned around that.\n- Ben is easier to reach on chat than by email.\n"
  },
